OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe COP31 climate talks in Turkey have
OL,8,Ffailed to agree a deal after the EU
OL,9,Fformally rejected the latest draft
OL,10,Fagreement - we're bringing you the
OL,11,Flatest updates and analysis here
OL,13,FThe summit's president says the deal
OL,14,Fhas not been approved, something our
OL,15,Freporter Esme Stallard, who is at the
OL,16,Fsummit in Antalya, says represents an
OL,17,Falmost unprecedented development
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
