OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn EU representative has accused some
OL,8,Foil states of hijacking talks after the
OL,9,Fbloc had been pushing to restore a
OL,10,Fcommitment to move away from fossil
OL,11,Ffuels - the fourth draft still contains
OL,12,Fno mention of fossil fuels
OL,14,FRussia defend opposing its inclusion -
OL,15,Fafter producers led by Saudi Arabia had
OL,16,Fcalled for its removal - and was
OL,17,Fdirectly critical of the EU in its
OL,18,Fspeech
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
