OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe latest draft acknowledges the goal
OL,8,Fset by the 2015 Paris Agreement of
OL,9,Fkeeping the rise in global temperatures
OL,10,Fbelow 1.5C is going to be missed - as
OL,11,Fwarming goes beyond this the effects of
OL,12,Fclimate change will ramp up
OL,13,Fsignificantly
OL,15,FThe summit is now the longest-running
OL,16,Fin history, with negotiations
OL,17,Fcontinuing two days after it had been
OL,18,Fdue to end - here's a timeline of how
OL,19,Fwe got here
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
