OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FShould countries be unable to reach
OL,8,Fconsensus, negotiations could be
OL,9,Fsuspended until next year, which has
OL,10,Fhappened only once before at a COP
OL,11,Fsummit
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/4
